{"video_id": "QDiBol5yCqE", "channel_id": "UCFMdEr1H3hhCIdoKwsK80Tw", "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T15:10:47.643152+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.4, "end_seconds": 4.96, "text": "Acceptance criteria are specific,"}, {"start_seconds": 2.56, "end_seconds": 6.88, "text": "measurable conditions that a feature or"}, {"start_seconds": 4.96, "end_seconds": 9.36, "text": "product must meet to be considered"}, {"start_seconds": 6.88, "end_seconds": 11.28, "text": "complete and ready for use. They define"}, {"start_seconds": 9.36, "end_seconds": 13.36, "text": "what success looks like from the user's"}, {"start_seconds": 11.28, "end_seconds": 15.28, "text": "perspective. Think of them as a"}, {"start_seconds": 13.36, "end_seconds": 16.96, "text": "checklist that answers the question,"}, {"start_seconds": 15.28, "end_seconds": 19.52, "text": "\"How will we know when this feature is"}, {"start_seconds": 16.96, "end_seconds": 21.6, "text": "done?\" Acceptance criteria bridge the"}, {"start_seconds": 19.52, "end_seconds": 24.4, "text": "gap between what developers build and"}, {"start_seconds": 21.6, "end_seconds": 27.12, "text": "what users actually need. They prevent"}, {"start_seconds": 24.4, "end_seconds": 29.44, "text": "misunderstandings, reduce rework, and"}, {"start_seconds": 27.12, "end_seconds": 33.28, "text": "ensure everyone on the team has a shared"}, {"start_seconds": 29.44, "end_seconds": 35.68, "text": "understanding of the goal."}, {"start_seconds": 33.28, "end_seconds": 38.48, "text": "Clear acceptance criteria reduce project"}, {"start_seconds": 35.68, "end_seconds": 40.48, "text": "risk and save time and money. They help"}, {"start_seconds": 38.48, "end_seconds": 43.2, "text": "teams avoid building the wrong thing by"}, {"start_seconds": 40.48, "end_seconds": 45.2, "text": "establishing clear expectations upfront."}, {"start_seconds": 43.2, "end_seconds": 47.52, "text": "When criteria are well- definfined,"}, {"start_seconds": 45.2, "end_seconds": 49.44, "text": "developers know exactly what to build,"}, {"start_seconds": 47.52, "end_seconds": 51.2, "text": "testers know what to verify, and"}, {"start_seconds": 49.44, "end_seconds": 53.92, "text": "stakeholders can confirm the feature"}, {"start_seconds": 51.2, "end_seconds": 56.64, "text": "delivers real value. Without acceptance"}, {"start_seconds": 53.92, "end_seconds": 58.56, "text": "criteria, teams often experience scope"}, {"start_seconds": 56.64, "end_seconds": 61.84, "text": "creep, missed deadlines, and"}, {"start_seconds": 58.56, "end_seconds": 63.68, "text": "disappointed users. Good criteria also"}, {"start_seconds": 61.84, "end_seconds": 68.6, "text": "serve as documentation for future"}, {"start_seconds": 63.68, "end_seconds": 68.6, "text": "maintenance and updates to your product."}, {"start_seconds": 68.72, "end_seconds": 73.28, "text": "Effective acceptance criteria follow a"}, {"start_seconds": 70.88, "end_seconds": 75.04, "text": "simple structure called given when then."}, {"start_seconds": 73.28, "end_seconds": 77.76, "text": "Given describes the starting condition"}, {"start_seconds": 75.04, "end_seconds": 80.0, "text": "or context, when describes the action or"}, {"start_seconds": 77.76, "end_seconds": 82.48, "text": "user behavior, then describes the"}, {"start_seconds": 80.0, "end_seconds": 84.4, "text": "expected outcome. Each criterion should"}, {"start_seconds": 82.48, "end_seconds": 86.72, "text": "be observable and testable, meaning"}, {"start_seconds": 84.4, "end_seconds": 88.96, "text": "someone can verify it without guessing."}, {"start_seconds": 86.72, "end_seconds": 91.2, "text": "Use clear, simple language that anyone"}, {"start_seconds": 88.96, "end_seconds": 93.92, "text": "on the team can understand. Avoid"}, {"start_seconds": 91.2, "end_seconds": 95.76, "text": "technical jargon. Focus on userfacing"}, {"start_seconds": 93.92, "end_seconds": 98.72, "text": "behavior rather than implementation"}, {"start_seconds": 95.76, "end_seconds": 100.72, "text": "details. A good rule of thumb is to"}, {"start_seconds": 98.72, "end_seconds": 104.52, "text": "write between three and five acceptance"}, {"start_seconds": 100.72, "end_seconds": 104.52, "text": "criteria per feature."}, {"start_seconds": 104.72, "end_seconds": 108.72, "text": "Acceptance criteria cover different"}, {"start_seconds": 106.64, "end_seconds": 110.56, "text": "aspects of your feature. Functional"}, {"start_seconds": 108.72, "end_seconds": 112.96, "text": "criteria describe what the feature"}, {"start_seconds": 110.56, "end_seconds": 114.96, "text": "should do. User experience criteria"}, {"start_seconds": 112.96, "end_seconds": 117.6, "text": "focus on how easy and intuitive the"}, {"start_seconds": 114.96, "end_seconds": 120.48, "text": "feature is to use. Edge case criteria"}, {"start_seconds": 117.6, "end_seconds": 122.96, "text": "handle unusual or boundary situations."}, {"start_seconds": 120.48, "end_seconds": 125.52, "text": "Scope criteria clarify what is included"}, {"start_seconds": 122.96, "end_seconds": 127.44, "text": "and excluded. Performance criteria"}, {"start_seconds": 125.52, "end_seconds": 130.32, "text": "define speed and responsiveness"}, {"start_seconds": 127.44, "end_seconds": 132.96, "text": "requirements. Security criteria ensure"}, {"start_seconds": 130.32, "end_seconds": 135.2, "text": "user data and system integrity."}, {"start_seconds": 132.96, "end_seconds": 136.56, "text": "Accessibility criteria ensure the"}, {"start_seconds": 135.2, "end_seconds": 138.8, "text": "feature works for users with"}, {"start_seconds": 136.56, "end_seconds": 141.44, "text": "disabilities. A complete set of"}, {"start_seconds": 138.8, "end_seconds": 144.92, "text": "acceptance criteria addresses most or"}, {"start_seconds": 141.44, "end_seconds": 144.92, "text": "all of these areas."}, {"start_seconds": 145.12, "end_seconds": 148.24, "text": "Scope defines the boundaries of what you"}, {"start_seconds": 146.96, "end_seconds": 150.8, "text": "are building and what you are not"}, {"start_seconds": 148.24, "end_seconds": 153.2, "text": "building. It answers questions like are"}, {"start_seconds": 150.8, "end_seconds": 155.28, "text": "we building this for mobile or desktop?"}, {"start_seconds": 153.2, "end_seconds": 156.96, "text": "Verification confirms that you built the"}, {"start_seconds": 155.28, "end_seconds": 159.84, "text": "feature correctly according to the"}, {"start_seconds": 156.96, "end_seconds": 162.24, "text": "acceptance criteria. It answers does the"}, {"start_seconds": 159.84, "end_seconds": 163.84, "text": "feature work as specified. Validation"}, {"start_seconds": 162.24, "end_seconds": 166.48, "text": "confirms that the feature actually"}, {"start_seconds": 163.84, "end_seconds": 168.72, "text": "solves the user's problem. It answers,"}, {"start_seconds": 166.48, "end_seconds": 170.32, "text": "\"Does the user find this valuable?"}, {"start_seconds": 168.72, "end_seconds": 172.88, "text": "Understanding the difference prevents"}, {"start_seconds": 170.32, "end_seconds": 175.92, "text": "wasted effort.\" A feature can pass"}, {"start_seconds": 172.88, "end_seconds": 180.32, "text": "verification but fail validation if it"}, {"start_seconds": 175.92, "end_seconds": 182.56, "text": "does not address the real user need."}, {"start_seconds": 180.32, "end_seconds": 184.8, "text": "Performance criteria set expectations"}, {"start_seconds": 182.56, "end_seconds": 186.96, "text": "for speed and responsiveness. For"}, {"start_seconds": 184.8, "end_seconds": 189.84, "text": "example, the page should load within 2"}, {"start_seconds": 186.96, "end_seconds": 191.84, "text": "seconds. Reliability criteria ensure the"}, {"start_seconds": 189.84, "end_seconds": 194.32, "text": "feature works consistently under various"}, {"start_seconds": 191.84, "end_seconds": 196.48, "text": "conditions. For example, the system"}, {"start_seconds": 194.32, "end_seconds": 199.44, "text": "should handle up to 1,000 concurrent"}, {"start_seconds": 196.48, "end_seconds": 201.44, "text": "users. Accessibility criteria ensure the"}, {"start_seconds": 199.44, "end_seconds": 204.08, "text": "feature works for everyone, including"}, {"start_seconds": 201.44, "end_seconds": 205.68, "text": "people with disabilities. For example,"}, {"start_seconds": 204.08, "end_seconds": 208.08, "text": "all buttons must have keyboard"}, {"start_seconds": 205.68, "end_seconds": 210.96, "text": "navigation support and sufficient color"}, {"start_seconds": 208.08, "end_seconds": 212.88, "text": "contrast. These criteria often get"}, {"start_seconds": 210.96, "end_seconds": 214.88, "text": "overlooked, but are essential for"}, {"start_seconds": 212.88, "end_seconds": 216.96, "text": "creating a product that works well for"}, {"start_seconds": 214.88, "end_seconds": 218.72, "text": "all users."}, {"start_seconds": 216.96, "end_seconds": 220.48, "text": "Remember"}, {"start_seconds": 218.72, "end_seconds": 222.88, "text": "that acceptance criteria must be"}, {"start_seconds": 220.48, "end_seconds": 224.8, "text": "observable, testable, and measurable."}, {"start_seconds": 222.88, "end_seconds": 226.88, "text": "Define your scope boundaries clearly to"}, {"start_seconds": 224.8, "end_seconds": 229.04, "text": "prevent scope creep. Distinguish between"}, {"start_seconds": 226.88, "end_seconds": 230.4, "text": "verification and validation to ensure"}, {"start_seconds": 229.04, "end_seconds": 232.24, "text": "you are building the right thing the"}, {"start_seconds": 230.4, "end_seconds": 234.08, "text": "right way. Include performance,"}, {"start_seconds": 232.24, "end_seconds": 236.64, "text": "reliability, and accessibility in your"}, {"start_seconds": 234.08, "end_seconds": 238.72, "text": "criteria. To implement this process,"}, {"start_seconds": 236.64, "end_seconds": 241.36, "text": "first draft three to five objective"}, {"start_seconds": 238.72, "end_seconds": 244.32, "text": "criteria per feature. Second, use the"}, {"start_seconds": 241.36, "end_seconds": 247.36, "text": "given when, then template format. Third,"}, {"start_seconds": 244.32, "end_seconds": 249.28, "text": "define success metrics and edge cases."}, {"start_seconds": 247.36, "end_seconds": 252.24, "text": "Fourth, review with stakeholders to"}, {"start_seconds": 249.28, "end_seconds": 255.36, "text": "confirm alignment. Finally, attach your"}, {"start_seconds": 252.24, "end_seconds": 257.6, "text": "criteria to user stories and test cases."}, {"start_seconds": 255.36, "end_seconds": 259.92, "text": "Use these principles consistently across"}, {"start_seconds": 257.6, "end_seconds": 263.12, "text": "your projects to improve quality and"}, {"start_seconds": 259.92, "end_seconds": 265.36, "text": "team communication."}, {"start_seconds": 263.12, "end_seconds": 268.88, "text": "If you like this video, hit that like"}, {"start_seconds": 265.36, "end_seconds": 271.6, "text": "button and don't forget to subscribe."}, {"start_seconds": 268.88, "end_seconds": 274.56, "text": "Visit codelucky.com for more such useful"}, {"start_seconds": 271.6, "end_seconds": 274.56, "text": "content."}]}